@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# LDG (GEM Dynamical Libraries) source pin for sdk/ldg/build-ldg.sh (TASK/LDG-M1).
+#
+# ldg-svn-r133.tar.xz = the tree in Applications/ldg-src/ldg, i.e. SVN trunk
+# r133 of https://svn.code.sf.net/p/ldg/code/trunk/ldg/ , fetched read-only on
+# 2026-10-04 by crawling the directory listings with curl (no svn client;
